                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Well crafted, relaxing puzzles: levels 35 to 50 are not easy, but can be solved by planning and discovering the symmetries. There is no time limit or move counter. Some puzzles have fail states (i.e. you can work youself into a dead end) which requires a restart of the level (for which there is a dedicated button in the gui). The handeling of the elements is nice, the look-and-feel is minimalistic and also nice.",
